INSERT INTO `Tab` VALUES (1,'GT','Tutorials',1,0,10,'This tab provides access to free vocabulary tutorials, as well as flashcards, crossword puzzles, card games, and more. The Tutorials Tab also provides access to three free animated grammar tutorials.','','2006-12-13 11:31:34','2006-12-13 17:31:34',0),(2,'SS','Practice',1,1,20,'This tab has very brief auto-graded <i>practice</i> activities for each section of every lesson in the textbook. It\'s a good idea to do these activities before you go to class or do your homework so that you\'ll be well prepared. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','You may do the <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook Tab as many times as you\'d like. You\'ll be able to see how well you did on the My Results Tab; your scores will not be figured into your grade. ','2006-12-13 11:31:34','2006-12-13 17:31:34',0),(3,'HW','Web-SAM',1,1,30,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br />\nYou must purchase a passcode in order to access the MAESTRO&trade; Web-SAM. Ask your instructor whether it\'s required for your course. If so, the Web-SAM passcode should have been packaged with your textbook, or you may purchase it <a href=\"http://www.vhldirect.com/\" target=\"_blank\">online.</a> <more><b>For more...</b></more>','On the Web-SAM Tab, there are <i>homework</i> activities for you to complete; these scores will be figured into your grade. You\'ll be able to do each activity twice; the higher of your two scores will be posted to the gradebook as part of your <i>homework</i> grade for the lesson. To make sure you earn the highest grade possible, prepare by viewing any corresponding materials on the Tutorials Tab and by doing <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook Tab before completing the activities on the Web-SAM Tab.','2006-12-13 11:31:34','2006-12-13 17:31:34',0),(4,'AS','Assessment',1,1,40,'This tab includes an auto-graded practice quiz for each lesson. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','To get ready for lesson quizzes or cumulative exams, complete the auto-graded practice quizzes or exams on the Assessment Tab. You\'ll be able to see how well you did on the My Results Tab, but the scores will not be figured into your grade.<br /><br />\nThe Assessment Tab also includes an auto-graded diagnostic quiz. Be sure to complete this on the Supersite. Your results will include an analysis of where you may need further study, as well as recommended materials for you to review.','2006-12-13 11:31:34','2006-12-13 17:31:34',0),(5,'MR','My Results',1,0,50,'Keep track of how well you\'ve done on <i>practice</i> and <i>homework</i> activities here. In addition to your scores, you\'ll be able to access any feedback-written or audio-that your instructor has provided.\n','','2006-12-13 11:31:34','2006-12-13 17:31:34',0),(6,'WB','Workbook',0,1,0,'','','2006-12-18 12:28:39','2006-12-18 18:28:39',0),(7,'VM','Video Manual',0,1,0,'','','2006-12-18 12:28:39','2006-12-18 18:28:39',0),(8,'LM','Lab Manual',0,1,0,'','','2006-12-18 12:28:39','2006-12-18 18:28:39',0),(9,'GT','Tutorials',1,0,0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br />\n\nEnhance your students\' online experience by using the Vista Higher Learning <b>DESCUBRE</b> Vocabulary and Grammar Tutorials. Please <a href=\"http://www.vistahigherlearning.com/findyoursalesrep/?secondary=1\" target=\"_blank\"><u>contact your Vista Higher Learning representative</u></a> about access to these tutorial materials and our <b>MAESTRO&trade;</b> language learning system. <more><b>For more...</b></more>\n','The Tutorials tab provides access to vocabulary and animated grammar tutorials that help students <i>learn</i> the new words, phrases, and grammar of each lesson. The vocabulary tutorials include flashcards, crossword puzzles, card games, and more. The Tutorials tab also provides links to grammar tables that summarize key grammatical concepts. If students need more help to <i>learn</i> grammar, animated grammar tutorials from 2 to 5 minutes long could be just what they need.','2007-01-22 15:14:17','2007-01-22 21:12:07',0),(10,'SS','Practice',1,1,0,'This tab has very brief auto-graded <i>practice</i> activities for each section of every lesson in the textbook. Students can do these activities after they\'ve read an explanation or selection in the textbook, viewed a video segment, or listened to an audio clip to find out how well they\'ve understood what they\'ve read, watched, or heard. It\'s a good idea for students to do these activities before they go to class or do their homework so that they\'re well prepared. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','Students can do the <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook tab as many times as they like. They will be able to see how well they did on the My Results tab; you will also be able to see how they did, but their score will not be figured into their grade.<br />  <br />  The Textbook tab includes an auto-graded quiz. Students will want to be sure to complete this on the Supersite, since their results will include an analysis of where they may need further study, as well as recommended materials for them to review.  ','2007-01-22 15:14:17','2007-01-22 21:12:07',0),(11,'HW','<span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">e-Cuaderno</span>',1,1,0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br />\n\nEnhance your students\' online experience by using the Vista Higher Learning <b>DESCUBRE e-Cuaderno</b> (online version of the <b>DESCUBRE Cuaderno de práctica</b>, video activities, and audio activities, with automatic scoring).  Please <a href=\"http://www.vistahigherlearning.com/findyoursalesrep/?secondary=1\" target=\"_blank\"><u>contact your Vista Higher Learning representative</u></a> about access to the <b>DESCUBRE e-Cuaderno</b> and our <b>MAESTRO&trade;</b> language learning system.. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','On the <b>e-Cuaderno</b> tab, students will complete <i>homework</i> activities for a score that will be figured into their grade. They will be able to do each activity twice; the higher of their two scores will be posted to the gradebook as part of their <i>homework</i> grade for the lesson. To make sure they earn the highest grade possible, students should prepare by viewing any corresponding materials on the Tutorials tab and by doing <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook tab before completing the activities on this <b>e-Cuaderno</b> tab.','2007-01-22 15:14:17','2007-01-22 21:12:07',0),(12,'AS','Assessment',1,1,0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br />\n\nEnhance your students\' online experience by using the Vista Higher Learning <b>DESCUBRE</b> Assessments.  Please <a href=\"http://www.vistahigherlearning.com/findyoursalesrep/?secondary=1\" target=\"_blank\"><u>contact your Vista Higher Learning representative</u></a> \nabout access to these assessment materials and our <b>MAESTRO&trade;</b> language learning system.. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','This tab includes an auto-graded practice quiz for each lesson. You may choose to administer your lesson quiz here, too.<br />\nTo get ready for lesson quizzes or cumulative exams, students can take auto-graded practice quizzes or exams on the Assessment tab. They\'ll be able to see how well they did on the My Results tab, but their score will not be figured into their grade.<br />The Assessment tab includes an auto-graded diagnostic quiz. Students will want to be sure to complete this on the Supersite, since their results will include an analysis of where they may need further study, as well as recommended materials for them to review.','2007-01-22 15:14:17','2007-01-22 21:12:07',0),(13,'MR','My Results',1,0,0,'Students can view how well they\'ve done on <i>practice</i> and <i>homework</i> activities here. In addition to their scores, they\'ll be able to access any feedback&mdash;written or audio&mdash;that you have provided.','','2007-01-22 15:14:17','2007-01-22 21:12:07',0),(14,'WB','Cuaderno de pr&aacute;ctica',0,1,0,'','','2007-01-23 10:27:19','2007-01-23 16:24:08',0),(15,'VM','Cuaderno de actividades - Video',0,1,0,'','','2007-01-23 10:27:19','2007-01-23 16:24:08',0),(16,'LM','Cuaderno de actividades - Audio',0,1,0,'','','2007-01-23 10:27:19','2007-01-23 16:24:08',0),(17,'GT','Tutorials',1,0,0,'This tab provides access to free vocabulary tutorials that help students <i>learn</i> the new words and phrases of each lesson. The vocabulary tutorials include flashcards, crossword puzzles, card games, and more. The Tutorials tab also provides access to three free animated grammar tutorials.','','2007-01-28 16:00:13','2007-01-28 22:01:03',0),(18,'HW','Web-SAM',1,1,0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br /> Enhance your students\' online experience by using the Vista Higher Learning MAESTRO&trade; Web-SAM (online version of the textbook\'s workbook, video manual, and lab manual, with automatic scoring). Students must purchase a passcode in order to access the MAESTRO&trade; Web-SAM. The Web-SAM passcode can be packaged with the textbook or purchased online. Please contact your Vista Higher Learning representative for exact pricing.<br /> The MAESTRO&trade; Web-SAM passcode should NOT be confused with the textbook\'s Supersite passcode. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','On the Web-SAM tab, students will complete <i>homework</i> activities for a score that will be figured into their grade. They will be able to do each activity twice; the higher of their two scores will be posted to the gradebook as part of their <i>homework</i> grade for the lesson. To make sure they earn the highest grade possible, students should prepare by viewing any corresponding materials on the Tutorials tab and by doing <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook tab before completing the activities on this Web-SAM tab.','2007-01-28 16:02:28','2007-01-28 22:01:03',0),(19,'AS','Assessment',1,1,0,'This tab includes an auto-graded practice quiz for each lesson. You may choose to administer your lesson quiz here, too. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','To get ready for lesson quizzes or cumulative exams, students can take auto-graded practice quizzes or exams on the Assessment tab. They\'ll be able to see how well they did on the My Results tab, but their score will not be figured into their grade.<br />The Assessment tab includes an auto-graded diagnostic quiz. Students will want to be sure to complete this on the Supersite, since their results will include an analysis of where they may need further study, as well as recommended materials for them to review.  ','2007-01-28 16:04:23','2007-01-28 22:01:03',0),(20,'HW','Web-SAM',1,1,0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br />\nYou must purchase a passcode in order to access the MAESTRO&trade; Web-SAM. Ask your instructor whether it\'s required for your course. If so, the Web-SAM passcode should have been packaged with your textbook, or you may purchase it <a href=\"http://www.vhldirect.com/program.php?pid=26#package_344\" target=\"_blank\">online.</a> <more><b>For more...</b></more>','On the Web-SAM Tab, there are <i>homework</i> activities for you to complete; these scores will be figured into your grade. You\'ll be able to do each activity twice; the higher of your two scores will be posted to the gradebook as part of your <i>homework</i> grade for the lesson. To make sure you earn the highest grade possible, prepare by doing <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook Tab before completing the activities on the Web-SAM Tab.','2007-02-23 12:45:43','2007-02-23 18:42:27',0),(21,'SS','Practice',1,1,20,'This tab has very brief auto-graded <i>practice</i> activities for each section of every lesson in the textbook. It\'s a good idea to do these activities before you go to class or do your homework so that you\'ll be well prepared. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','You may do the <i>practice</i> activities on the Textbook Tab as many time